Modifications
-------------
  Modified in 2026 by Bjerreman and contributors.
  (No separate copyright is claimed over these modifications.)

  This is a modified version of N64FlashcartMenu. It adds, among other changes:
  a cover-art Favorites Grid front-end, a unified popup-based UI, a baked-in
  box-art and text-metadata library, a 64DD disc-linking workflow, an idle
  screensaver, and file-management tools. See README.md (its changelog
  section) and CHANGELOG.md for the full list of changes.

  First public pre-release: 2026.

